          "Example: A Member tier Changi Rewards member made a purchase that cost S$105.90. Total Bill: S$105.90 Less: Vouchers Used - In-store voucher issued by the store: S$20.00 Nett Payment (by Cash/NETS/Credit Card): S$80.90 Changi Rewards points to be awarded: 80 points (round down to nearest S$10 dollar) Minimum of S$10 (payable amount) for points to be awarded.",
          "Changi Rewards Card must be presented at the point of sale for Changi Rewards points to be awarded. \"For every payment, cashiers should proactively ask if the customer is a Changi Rewards member to ensure they receive all applicable benefits (e.g. parking, gift with purchase, purchase with purchase), especially when total spend is required to trigger automatic issuance. These benefits will not apply if the card is not presented at the time of purchase, even if points are claimed later.",
          "For instances that require retrospective claims (post transaction manual points crediting), members may claim their points as follows:",
          "i. Submit their requests to via Max Chatbot or Contact Us webform, with the member\u2019s Changi Rewards card number and a copy of the scanned receipt. Processing time will take 7 business days from the date when all supporting documents are received. Members must send in their retrospective claims request within 7 days of their purchase. Points will be available for redemption after seven (7) calendar days from the time the points were earned.",
          "ii. When system is down/offline, points have already been captured locally at the POS and will be updated in member's account once system is back online. Tenants do not need to direct members to write in.",
          "iii. Please contact NEC (Retail POS) at 6906 8799 or Epoint (F&B POS) at 6100 0231 (Available 24 Hours) if the POS is offline. Please refer to image below for sample of an offline POS and Offline transaction/ receipt.",
          "NEC (Retail POS)",
          "Epoint (F&B POS)",
          "B. Administering 9% GST Absorption discount for members",
          "Members who have forgotten to present/ bring their Changi Rewards e-Card are not eligible for the members-only 9% GST absorbed prices at landside retail outlets and Changi Rewards points.",
          "Kindly note that the 9% GST can only be given by tenants via scanning of member\u2019s Changi Rewards e-Card. The Changi Rewards service counter is not able to administer the 9% GST savings at the counter. Please do not direct passengers to the counter for members/shoppers to claim the 9% GST savings.",
          "CAG will conduct the necessary investigations with the CAG POS vendors and the outlet, should we receive feedback from members that they are unable to clock reward points due to a fault with the CAG POS terminal. For customer complaints regarding any outlet pertaining to the non-issuance/ incorrect issuance of the Changi Rewards points and/or provision of wrong information on the programme to any customers, the outlet will be disqualified from the monthly Commercial QSM incentives (as per current practice for any staff service complaints received).",
          "C. Refund or Voiding of Changi Rewards purchases",
          "For any refund of purchases, the Changi Rewards points earned on the purchase of the goods shall be debited from member\u2019s account automatically upon processing of the refund via POS terminals. Kindly note that this includes error keying of a transaction (i.e. cashier voids a transaction due to incorrect payment mode and re-transact with a subsequent sale with the correct payment). Cashiers are to swipe the member\u2019s card for the subsequent transaction to allow points to be re-credited into member\u2019s account.",
          "If the refund and points debit involve a tier change, member\u2019s new tier will be effective immediately, and member will get the benefits associated with the new tier. Should tenants encounter any problems crediting/ debiting points due to refund/ exchange requests, please write-in for assistance.",
          "Applicants must be 16 years and above at the time of Changi Rewards application. Rewards Card is now available on Changi App and Changi Rewards no longer issues physical cards for new membership registrations. Members are advised to use the Rewards Card by downloading the Changi App.",
